{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build. Expand. Rise to the top.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a handful of natural resources, you\u2019ll design, build, and optimize your own network of factories. Complete clear objectives and unlock new machines as you climb the ranks from humble operator to ultimate magnate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most factory games, <i>Factory Magnate</i> is designed to be approachable \u2014 no spreadsheets, no wikis, no ratios to memorize. Just satisfying production lines, steady progress, and that feeling of watching everything click into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/ee9018611524b6fbf3066354cd7e1428.poster.avif?t=1767970061\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/ee9018611524b6fbf3066354cd7e1428.webm?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/ee9018611524b6fbf3066354cd7e1428.mp4?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/aad5f776035f10c58f3216fe72fa78cc.avif?t=1767970061\" width=780 height=95 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approachable Factory Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and grow at your own pace. Build machines, connect production lines, and unlock new technologies \u2014 all without the pressure of endless complexity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective-Based Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always know what you\u2019re working toward. Each objective gives you a clear goal, rewarding you with new machines, items, and tools to expand your production empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/68af2f5ed8c880ec493d91b418182e37.poster.avif?t=1767970061\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/68af2f5ed8c880ec493d91b418182e37.webm?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/68af2f5ed8c880ec493d91b418182e37.mp4?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endgame with a Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can actually <i>finish</i> this factory game. Complete the final objective to reach the top and claim your title as the ultimate Factory Magnate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depth Without Overload</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 25 machines and buildings, and over 50 items to produce and refine \u2014 enough depth to stay engaging, but not so much that you\u2019ll need an online encyclopedia to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/f2fc9dba5e1819424963a51f0de2f4c6.poster.avif?t=1767970061\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/f2fc9dba5e1819424963a51f0de2f4c6.webm?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/f2fc9dba5e1819424963a51f0de2f4c6.mp4?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map offers a new layout and set of challenges. Expand across landscapes filled with resources and room to grow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies. No combat. No time limits. Just the quiet satisfaction of watching your creations hum to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/96593858b9cc9c2531e8f8db5505c320.poster.avif?t=1767970061\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/96593858b9cc9c2531e8f8db5505c320.webm?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/extras/96593858b9cc9c2531e8f8db5505c320.mp4?t=1767970061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve ever wanted to try a factory builder but found them too overwhelming, <i>Factory Magnate</i> is made for you. It\u2019s all the joy of design and optimization \u2014 streamlined into a relaxing, goal-driven experience you can enjoy in short or long sessions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1475310?t=1767970061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767970061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767970061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767970061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","